[862.37832, "o", "\u001b[39;49m\u001b]104\u0007\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[?2004h\u001b[?1h\u001b=\u001b[?1h\u001b=\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m  GNU nano 8.7.1                                                             README.md                                                                      \u001b[1;155H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[862.379582, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m# Build It Anywhere — Pair Project Repository\r\u001b[4d\u001b[32m**Cyber Sentinel Programme, Cohort 3, Year 2 — Hein Wagner Academy**\r\u001b[6d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mThis is your pair's project repository for the whole year. It \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m**is**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m your portfolio: everything you build, secure, and prove lives here, and its commit his\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[8;1H\u001b(B\u001b[mReplace the placeholders below in your first Friday (Phase 1), then commit.\r\u001b[10d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m---\r\u001b[12d## Our pair\r\u001b[14d\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**Persona:**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[32m_(Thusanang Microlending)_\r\u001b[15d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**Student A:**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[32m_(Yanga Tutshana)_\r\u001b[16d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**Student B:**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[32m_(Hattinie Freyer)_\r\u001b[17d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**The platform in one paragraph:**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[32m_(write this in Phase 1 and refine it all year — what you are building, for whom, and why it matters to the business)_\r\u001b[19d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## How this repository is organised\r\u001b[21d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mEvery folder has its own \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36m`README.md`\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m explaining exactly what belongs in it. In order of the year:\r\u001b[23d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**charter/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — your project charter, business profile, and POPIA exposure assessment (Phase 1)\r\u001b[24d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**threat-model/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the threat model, versions 0 to 3, each kept (Phases 1 to 4)\r\u001b[25d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**architecture/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the Bicep design, identity model, control mapping, and Mermaid diagrams with written descriptions (Phase 2)\r\u001b[26d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**infrastructure/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the OpenTofu definition and its plan output (Phase 3B onward)\r\u001b[27d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**hardening/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the Ansible playbook and Lynis before-and-after reports (Phase 3A)\r\u001b[28d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**containers/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the Dockerfile and image scan reports (Phase 3B and 3D)\r\u001b[29d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**runbooks/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — shutdown and restore, disaster recovery, and incident response (Phases 3A, 3C, 4)\r\u001b[30d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**ai/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the AI feature, its risk assessment, and its governance controls (Phase 4)\r\u001b[31d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**automation/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — your Python tooling with tests (Phase 5)\r\u001b[32d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**cost/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — the costed bill of materials and scenario models (Phase 5)\r\u001b[33d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**evidence/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — asciinema casts, scanner reports, log extracts, pipeline run records (all year)\r\u001b[34d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m- \u001b[32m**reflections/**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m — one reflection \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m**per student, per phase**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m, in your own words (all year)\r\u001b[36d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m## The one rule that matters most\r\u001b[38d\u001b[32m**Evidence is always text.**\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m No screenshots, anywhere, ever. Every proof of work is a committed file, a terminal transcript (\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36m`asciinema`\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m), a scanner report\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[40;1H^G\u001b(B\u001b[m Help\u001b[40;18H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^O\u001b(B\u001b[m Write Out     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^F\u001b(B\u001b[m Where Is\u001b[52G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^K\u001b(B\u001b[m Cut\u001b[40;69H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^T\u001b(B\u001b[m Execute\u001b[86G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^C\u001b(B\u001b[m Location\u001b[103G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-U\u001b(B\u001b[m Undo\u001b[40;120H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-A\u001b(B\u001b[m Set Mark     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-]\u001b(B\u001b[m To Bracket\r\u001b[41d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^X\u001b(B\u001b[m Exit\u001b[41;18H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^R\u001b(B\u001b[m Read File     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^\\\u001b(B\u001b[m Replace\u001b[52G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^U\u001b(B\u001b[m Paste\u001b[41;69H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^J\u001b(B\u001b[m Justify\u001b[86G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^/\u001b(B\u001b[m Go To Line    \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-E\u001b(B\u001b[m Redo\u001b[41;120H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-6\u001b(B\u001b[m Copy\u001b[41;137H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^B\u001b(B\u001b[m Where Was\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[6d\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
