[1412.118511, "o", "\r\u001b[40d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^G\u001b(B\u001b[m Help\u001b[40;18H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^O\u001b(B\u001b[m Write Out     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^F\u001b(B\u001b[m Where Is\u001b[52G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^K\u001b(B\u001b[m Cut\u001b[40;69H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^T\u001b(B\u001b[m Execute\u001b[86G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^C\u001b(B\u001b[m Location\u001b[103G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-U\u001b(B\u001b[m Undo\u001b[40;120H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-A\u001b(B\u001b[m Set Mark     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-]\u001b(B\u001b[m To Bracket\r\u001b[41d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^X\u001b(B\u001b[m Exit\u001b[41;17H \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^R\u001b(B\u001b[m Read File     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^\\\u001b(B\u001b[m Replace\u001b[52G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^U\u001b(B\u001b[m Paste\u001b[41;69H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^J\u001b(B\u001b[m Justify\u001b[86G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^/\u001b(B\u001b[m Go To Line    \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-E\u001b(B\u001b[m Redo\u001b[41;120H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-6\u001b(B\u001b[m Copy\u001b[41;137H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^B\u001b(B\u001b[m Where Was"]
[1412.120151, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[36m# Build It Anywhere — Pair Project Repository\r\u001b[4d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m**Cyber Sentinel Programme, Cohort 3, Year 2 — Hein Wagner Academy**\u001b[6;63H**is**\r\u001b[10d---\r\u001b[12d\u001b[36m## Our pair\r\u001b[14d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m- **Persona:** _(Thusanang Microlending)_\r\u001b[15d- **Student A:** _(Yanga Tutshana)_\r\u001b[16d- **Student B:** _(Hattinie Freyer)_\r\u001b[17d- **The platform in one paragraph:** _(write this in Phase 1 and refine it all year — what you are building, for whom, and why it matters to the business)_\r\u001b[19d\u001b[36m## How this repository is organised\u001b[21;26H\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m`README.md`\r\u001b[23d- **charter/**\r\u001b[24d- **threat-model/**\r\u001b[25d- **architecture/**\r\u001b[26d- **infrastructure/**\r\u001b[27d- **hardening/**\r\u001b[28d- **containers/**\r\u001b[29d- **runbooks/**\r\u001b[30d- **ai/**\r\u001b[31d- **automation/**\r\u001b[32d- **cost/**\r\u001b[33d- **evidence/**\r\u001b[34d- **reflections/**\u001b[34;37H**per student, per phase**\r\u001b[36d\u001b[36m## The one rule that matters most\r\u001b[38d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m**Evidence is always text.**\u001b[38;126H`asciinema`\u001b[5;15H\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
